{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_021_1000_043nor", "source_sha256": "f61ae25d9fb5c7629072dd92e8e4d887af67f603a01e0749cbf202f15684e7af", "ja": "ねえねえ、紗代子、聞いたよ！\n次の公演、センターなんだって？\nおめでと～！！", "zh": "欸欸，纱代子，我听说了！\n你是下次公演的Center对吧！\n恭喜你～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_021_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "32a85a4b15d6eb4e4b69786a182cbb7889f41cf00f2879a8352b6d6ef7cc1ecb", "ja": "マジで！？　すっげー！\nやったな、紗代子！", "zh": "真的吗！？好强喔──！\n太棒了，纱代子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_021_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "f2d9eed9be436c3aa37917e146196e15a01c29ccf1c61ef516c4820f06528d10", "ja": "ふふっ、ありがとう！\n私、いつも以上に気合いを入れて\nがんばるつもりだよ！", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢你们！\n我要比平时更加把劲，\n努力做好准备！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_021_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "f92892ffdd8917d8f37e01871cdf88a5c0dc7a96dadc0fa44b70aac7f87b84e9", "ja": "公演まで毎日特訓して、\nはずかしくないステージに\nしないと……！", "zh": "到公演之前，我要每天做特训，\n拿出对得起自己的表演才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_021_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "ad4b87536bedb3bae1c58025bf776ded4582933683512742ef9466591bbd6eeb", "ja": "特訓かぁ。よし、それさ、アタシも\n付き合うよ！　誰かと一緒の方が\n絶対やる気でるもんね♪", "zh": "特训啊……好耶，那我也奉陪！\n有伙伴陪同，\n肯定会更有干劲嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_021_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "26f24533c98762a59862733f884e1fbdbd1b4020298f69daafddc701025ec1cb", "ja": "オレもオレも！\nへへ、特訓ってなんか燃えるよな～♪", "zh": "我也要我也要！\n嘿嘿，「特训」听起来真热血耶～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_021_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_021_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "9b94f1c1677ca780c6af50e0724c91783ed104334d3feada34b4eac91e31fbaa", "ja": "のり子さん、昴ちゃん……はい！\nよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "法子、小昴……嗯！\n请你们多多指教了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
